{"answer_text":"Several affordable CRMs now include email sequences without a separate sales-engagement tool. Good choices: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: Powerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier. [2]\n- **Tallyfox**: Built for teams under 20, with email sequences on every plan and a setup most people finish in an afternoon. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: A sales-engagement tool with a CRM attached; sequences and call tasks are its strength. [4]\n- **Brightdesk**: A help desk with light CRM features — fine if support is your main workflow. [5]\n\nIn short, trial Northwind CRM and Tallyfox side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50a8-75b2-8b4c-ba3a321da9fe","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:15.050Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["affordable crm email automation","crm email sequences pricing comparison","crm with email sequences included"],"latency_ms":4200,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[117,130],[595,608]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[241,249],[613,621]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":